# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Solver Bot — Environment Variables
#
# When using deploy-solver.sh (recommended), most variables are set
# automatically from e2e/.env.local or e2e/staging/.env.staging.
# This file is only needed if you run the bot directly (npx tsx src/index.ts).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Mode: "local" (anvil) or "staging" (Monad testnet)
MODE=local

# ─── Set automatically by deploy-solver.sh ───────────────────────────────────
# These are sourced from the env file for the selected mode.
# Only set them manually if running the bot without deploy-solver.sh.
#
# RPC_URL=http://localhost:8545
# CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0x...
# API_URL=http://localhost:3002

# ─── Solver keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# For local mode, deploy-solver.sh maps Anvil accounts 4, 6, 7 automatically.
# For staging mode, set these in e2e/staging/.env.staging.
#
# SOLVER1_KEY=
# SOLVER2_KEY=
# SOLVER3_KEY=

# ─── Optional tuning ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Minimum native gas balance required (wei). Default: 5 MON (5e18).
# Checked on startup in staging mode; local mode auto-funds via anvil.
MIN_GAS=5000000000000000000

# Polling interval in milliseconds. Default: 5000.
POLL_INTERVAL_MS=5000
